        <item>
            <title>3.32.3</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:09:12 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>244</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.32.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Starting a session no longer rewrites `~/.claude/settings.json` when the selected model and effort are already set. The rewrite reformatted the whole file, so dotfile managers such as chezmoi saw it as locally edited and stopped updating it.
- A `settings.json` that cannot be parsed (for example one caught half-written) is no longer replaced by a file holding only the model and effort, which dropped every other setting. Canopy now leaves it untouched and logs an error.
]]></description>
